WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
There is a freight elevator thirty meters to the southeast

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
The password should be 1218

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
If you can, take your children and run away.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,580
Why run away

5
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,580
what on earth is he talking about

6
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:11,580
He is an old man from Xiayan

7
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:13,580
How do you know the elevator and password?

8
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:14,580
What the old man said

9
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:15,580
Something's wrong

10
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,610
detect an ability

11
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:18,610
Registration in original research is not a routine matter

12
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:19,610
That's the core and the trap

13
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:20,610
And a mobile phone

14
00:00:20,610 --> 00:00:22,610
The Asian Games team was obviously on the phone all the way

15
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:23,610
Why did Dandan take us away?

16
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:24,610
A useless device

17
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:26,610
This is not isolation protection at all

18
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:28,610
This is a man-eating trap

19
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:29,670
no window

20
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,670
Not even a vent

21
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:32,670
Where is this lounge?

22
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:34,770
It's clearly the room where people were taken to the execution ground to seek spiritual healing.

23
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:36,090
Don't be afraid

24
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:37,090
Even if something is really wrong

25
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:38,440
Even if I risk my life

26
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,440
And never let them touch a hair
